    "confidence": 0.95,
    "explanation": "To both parties: the $4.50 cancellation fee is not chargeable and is refunded in full.\n\nThe decisive ground is POL-NS-10(a): a rider's cancellation within platform_policy.grace_after_match_sec of the trip's accepted_at timestamp is not chargeable, whatever the driver's position. Reading the figures off the record, trip record EV-TRIP-02737 shows accepted_at 2026-09-15T15:07:39 and cancelled_at 2026-09-15T15:09:39 — 120 seconds — against the grace_after_match_sec of 180 seconds carried in the record's own platform_policy. 120 is inside 180, so POL-NS-10(c) requires the fee to be refunded in full with no driver compensation. Fare breakdown EV-FARE-02737 shows the cancellation_fee line at 4.50, total_charged 4.50, payment_status CHARGED and refund_issued_sgd 0.00, which is the amount returned.\n\nBoth sides' further refund grounds are accepted and would give the same result independently: there is no 'arrived' event (arrived_at null), qualifying_fix_count is 0 with no in-geofence fix anywhere, longest_qualifying_run.duration_sec is 0.0 against the 180 s minimum dwell, and the driver's own fixes (18 of them) run at 57.1–62.6 km/h with a closest approach of 6833.3 m to the pin. POL-NS-01 limbs (a) to (d), POL-NS-02, POL-NS-05 and POL-NS-06 therefore cannot hold against the rider. They are not needed to decide the fee — the grace disposes of it — but they confirm there was no arrival and no waiting clock. The rider-presence point under POL-NS-04 / POL-NS-11 is not reached, because the fee falls away on the grace alone; the single rider fix 8.8 m from the pin is noted but does not drive this outcome.\n\nThe driver's position is also that no compensation is owed, and I agree: POL-NS-07 pays a payout only where POL-NS-01 is satisfied in full or POL-NS-10(g) applies, and neither holds here. The anti-farming check does not trip (no_show_terminations_30d 0, completed_trips_30d 113), and the reason code RIDER_CANCELLED is not one of the three no-show codes POL-NS-01(d) recognises, so the no-show limbs were never engaged.\n\nOn confidence: the deciding facts rest on artifacts at full weight — trip record EV-TRIP-02737 and fare breakdown EV-FARE-02737, both COMPLETE with weight_multiplier 1.0. The GPS trace is likewise COMPLETE at 100.0% coverage, 10 s cadence, no gaps. Nothing in POL-NS-08(a)–(d) is engaged and no POL-NS-09 trigger (contradiction, repeat-party pattern, abuse, impaired sole evidence, or a sub-0.70 floor) arises, so the ruling carries full confidence and no escalation. The two advisory claims that relied on EV-ADVIS-02737-01 (MISSING, weight 0.0) were discarded by the referee for not disclosing that impairment; the advisory plays no part in this outcome. The refund of $4.50 is at or below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of $8.00 and executes automatically on issue. The profiles produce no adverse inference against either party."
